# Build context for server-rs/Dockerfile is the repository root. BuildKit reads
# this file (named after the Dockerfile) instead of a root .dockerignore, so the
# production Node service's build is unaffected.
#
# Allow-list: only the client and the Rust crate go into the context. Never
# send SQLite databases, .env files or build output.
*
!client/
!server-rs/
client/node_modules
client/dist
client/.env*
server-rs/target
server-rs/.env
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
